    objectives: ["I can describe ecosystems, communities and interdependence", "I can explain how abiotic and biotic factors affect communities", "I can use quadrats and transects and estimate population size", "I can describe the carbon and water cycles and the role of decomposers", "I can explain how humans affect biodiversity and evaluate ways to protect it", "I can calculate efficiency of biomass transfer (Biology only)"],
